          "value": "<p>When the captain of the guard rolls a success on a Will save against a fear effect, they get a critical success instead.</p>\n<p>In addition, any time they gain the @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened} condition, reduce its value by 1.</p>"
